	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Fuzzy-find and open mdmarks Bookmarks. Keyword `bm` runs a Script Filter over `mdmarks search --format alfred`; Enter runs `mdmarks open` on the selected Bookmark's verbatim URL; right-arrow (→) hands the URL to Alfred's Universal Actions (Copy URL, and the rest). The graph is authored directly in this info.plist - do not re-export from the Alfred GUI, which would drop the committed structure. Requires the `mdmarks` binary; the scripts prepend the standard Nix profile directories to PATH, or set MDMARKS_BIN in the configuration sheet to an absolute path.</string>
